 "stage": 2,
 "lesson": 10,
 "title": {
  "de": "Lies das Schild",
  "en": "Read the sign"
 },
 "intro": {
  "de": "Mit Hangeul kannst du jetzt Schilder lesen. Diese Wörter siehst du überall in Bahnhöfen und auf der Straße.\nNeue Regel: Nach den Endlauten k, t, p wird ein folgendes ㄱ, ㄷ, ㅂ, ㅅ, ㅈ gespannt. 입구 klingt wie 입꾸, 식당 wie 식땅.",
  "en": "With Hangeul you can now read signs. You'll see these words everywhere in stations and on the street.\nNew rule: after the final sounds k, t, p, a following ㄱ, ㄷ, ㅂ, ㅅ, ㅈ becomes tense. 입구 sounds like 입꾸, 식당 like 식땅."
 },
 "exercises": [
  "see-sound",
  "see-meaning",
  "hear-meaning",
  "pick-hangul"
 ],
